Terminals which are not used

   ARROW
   RESERVED


Grammar

    0 $accept: Program $end

    1 Program: CLASS IDENTIFIER LBRACE MemberList RBRACE

    2 MemberList: /* empty */
    3           | MemberList MethodDecl
    4           | MemberList FieldDecl
    5           | MemberList SEMICOLON

    6 MethodDecl: PUBLIC STATIC MethodHeader MethodBody

    7 FieldDecl: PUBLIC STATIC Type IDENTIFIER IdentifierList SEMICOLON
    8          | error SEMICOLON

    9 IdentifierList: /* empty */
   10               | IdentifierList COMMA IDENTIFIER

   11 Type: BOOL
   12     | INT
   13     | DOUBLE

   14 MethodHeader: Type IDENTIFIER LPAR RPAR
   15             | Type IDENTIFIER LPAR FormalParams RPAR
   16             | VOID IDENTIFIER LPAR RPAR
   17             | VOID IDENTIFIER LPAR FormalParams RPAR

   18 FormalParams: ParamList
   19             | STRING LSQ RSQ IDENTIFIER

   20 ParamList: Type IDENTIFIER
   21          | ParamList COMMA Type IDENTIFIER

   22 MethodBody: LBRACE StatementOrVarDecl RBRACE

   23 StatementOrVarDecl: /* empty */
   24                   | StatementOrVarDecl Statement
   25                   | StatementOrVarDecl VarDecl

   26 VarDecl: Type IDENTIFIER IdentifierList SEMICOLON

   27 Statement: LBRACE StatementList RBRACE
   28          | IF LPAR ExprOrAssign RPAR Statement
   29          | IF LPAR ExprOrAssign RPAR Statement ELSE Statement
   30          | WHILE LPAR ExprOrAssign RPAR Statement
   31          | RETURN SEMICOLON
   32          | RETURN ExprOrAssign SEMICOLON
   33          | SEMICOLON
   34          | MethodInvocation SEMICOLON
   35          | Assignment SEMICOLON
   36          | ParseArgs SEMICOLON
   37          | PRINT LPAR ExprOrAssign RPAR SEMICOLON
   38          | PRINT LPAR STRLIT RPAR SEMICOLON
   39          | IF LPAR error RPAR Statement
   40          | IF LPAR error RPAR Statement ELSE Statement
   41          | WHILE LPAR error RPAR Statement
   42          | error SEMICOLON

   43 StatementList: /* empty */
   44              | StatementList Statement

   45 ExprOrAssign: Expr
   46             | Assignment

   47 MethodInvocation: IDENTIFIER LPAR RPAR
   48                 | IDENTIFIER LPAR ArgList RPAR
   49                 | IDENTIFIER LPAR error RPAR

   50 ArgList: ExprOrAssign
   51        | ArgList COMMA ExprOrAssign

   52 Assignment: IDENTIFIER ASSIGN ExprOrAssign

   53 ParseArgs: PARSEINT LPAR IDENTIFIER LSQ ExprOrAssign RSQ RPAR
   54          | PARSEINT LPAR error RPAR

   55 Expr: Expr PLUS Expr
   56     | Expr MINUS Expr
   57     | Expr STAR Expr
   58     | Expr DIV Expr
   59     | Expr MOD Expr
   60     | Expr AND Expr
   61     | Expr OR Expr
   62     | Expr XOR Expr
   63     | Expr LSHIFT Expr
   64     | Expr RSHIFT Expr
   65     | Expr EQ Expr
   66     | Expr GE Expr
   67     | Expr GT Expr
   68     | Expr LE Expr
   69     | Expr LT Expr
   70     | Expr NE Expr
   71     | MINUS Expr
   72     | PLUS Expr
   73     | NOT Expr
   74     | LPAR ExprOrAssign RPAR
   75     | LPAR error RPAR
   76     | MethodInvocation
   77     | ParseArgs
   78     | IDENTIFIER
   79     | IDENTIFIER DOTLENGTH
   80     | NATURAL
   81     | DECIMAL
   82     | BOOLLIT


